<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#esen_30m_mp_esen_architecture> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#hasParameterNumber> "30085121"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "model_params: 30085121; Section 6.1: eSEN with 30M parameters" ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2502.12147.pdf> .
<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#esen_30m_mp_esen_architecture> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/trainingonto#usesDataset> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/dataset-individuals#mptrj> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "Section 6.1: trained on MPTrj; Section 6.1: eSEN-30M-OAM pre-trained on OMat24 then fine-tuned on sAlex and MPTrj; Section 6.3: trained on SPICE-MACE-OFF" ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2502.12147.pdf> .
